==Event Information==
Outstanding!!! Brilliant!!! The Battle Cats has reached 76 Million installs from players around the world! A BIG thanks from all of us on the Battle Cats team! Lets celebrate this amazing milestone with special stages and events!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On November 14th (11:00am) through November 28th, 2022 (10:59am)'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Celebration Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Get awesome rewards from daily Login Stamps,<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On November 14th, 2022 (11:00am) through January 16th, 2023 (10:59am)'''}}
Earn one stamp each day when you visit the Cat Base menu in The Battle Cats! Each stamp provides you with awesome rewards, including a possible {{Color|#46BDC6|'''total of 9 Rare Tickets and 9 Cat Tickets if you log in every single day during the event!'''}} Logging in for 30 days will also earn you the {{Color|#FF0000|'''limited Special Unit "Gold Brick Cat"!'''}} Don't miss a single day to unlock this awesome reward! ※ Up to 30 Login Stamps are available from this event. ※ After collecting Gold Brick Cat, please visit the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu to activate the character.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6600|During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#34A853|'''even days (11/14, 11/16, 11/18, 11/20, 11/22, 11/24, 11/26, 11/28)'''}} visit '''Empire of Cats''', and on{{Color|#46BDC6|'''odd days (11/15, 11/17, 11/19, 11/21, 11/23, 11/25, 11/27)'''}} head to {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event! Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''11/16, 11/19, 11/22, 11/25, 11/28!'''}}

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#46BDC6|'''XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・XP Harvest (3 areas)'''}}<br>
On from November 14th (11:00am) until November 21st, 2022 (10:59am)!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Cats Eye Cave'''}}<br>
On from November 21st (11:00am) until November 28th, 2022 (10:59am)!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Item Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catseye Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Catseye Item Capsules'''}}<br>
On from November 14th (11:00am) until November 21st, 2022 (10:59am)!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Catfruit Item Capsules'''}}<br>
On from November 21st (11:00am) until November 28th, 2022 (10:59am)!

※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is cleared.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Foo'''}}{{Color|#FF00FF|d}} each day of the campaign!<br>
Don't miss a day for maximum Cat Food profit!

